    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是格格的妈妈，皇额娘～</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客会邀请一些我身边的有趣、好玩、优秀的好朋友们到聊天室里来聊天，欢迎大家来参与、互动～</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期，终于是开启了🔛</span></p><span></span><p><span>非常非常开心，期待我的播客之旅～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期高光】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a>：播客为什么叫这个名字？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a>：我觉得一个家庭里面，核心关系应该是夫妻关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a>：生孩子之前跟生孩子之后，工作会又变化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a>：嗯，你得自己把自己先搞好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a>：你把你老公排在第二位，你是恋爱脑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a>：有的朋友陪你走一段，有的朋友陪你走一辈子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a>：作为hr,你怎么看待不专业的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a>：作为hr,你怎么看裁员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a>：你为什么不内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a>：我永远把自己排在第一位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a>：我只做60分的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a>：我的人生很妙吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最让人开心的东西：是惊喜和废话鸭～</span></p>]]></description>
